            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dinh Restaurant 5",
            "review_text": "JamonaJava\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam71 contributions\n1\nBecame Mediocre BBQ Place\nJun 2019\nThis is a part of well known BBQ franchise called Uraetei. As often happens to successful franchise, the quality of food and service went down quickly, while prices gradually go up. Unfortunately this has dropped out of my restaurant list. There are many better BBQ restaurant choices in District 7 around so called Korean Town.\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 17, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
