            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dinh Restaurant 5",
            "review_text": "Flyingstars\nMelbourne, Australia624 contributions\n0\nSeating in booths & no wine.\nApr 2019\nKnowing how much the Vietnamese love their Bbq we went to Pho Dinh Restaurant at the recommendation of a friend. Disappointment on arrival to discover it wasn't a Vietnamese Bbq however thought we would give it a go anyway. Once we got someone's attention to order - the food arrived quite promptly. The seating is in booths, service was friendly, the food OK, no wine by the glass so had beers. Note this is NOT a complaint - seemed like we were in Japan not Saigon, and missed that jovial noisy casual atmosphere. Yes I know we could have gone somewhere else - this may help someone else ...\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten September 10, 2019",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
