            "review_title": "Review at Pho Dinh Restaurant 5",
            "review_text": "Graham R\nBrisbane, Australia33 contributions\n0\nLunch\nOct 2018 • Couples\nWe were doing a short stopover and were looking for a place to eat for lunch and walked around the corner from our hotel to find this place.\nThe food was great you select your types of meat and how much . They bring it all to the table and you cook it in the centre of the table over hot coals on a steel mesh grill over the coals. It’s a fantastic way to get a truly fresh meal.\n The service was good the value for money is very good \nYeh food was awesome and plenty of it for lunch \nYou appetite is only limited by how much you order\nRead more\nWritten October 23, 2018",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-15",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
